  "subject": "A Wanhua rooftop pigeon keeper whose grey hen keeps coming home with the same unringed stray cock, so he grumbles, nails up a second box and scatters extra grain.",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien luk thung, easy Thai-style country dance groove. Phin guitar picking bright lead lines with slides; ranat ek xylophone doubling the hook; electric bass walking on the beat; drum kit with a woodblock on the backbeat; alto saxophone answering each vocal line. Dry vintage 1970s studio mix, bright guitar, plain close vocal. Male baritone, warm and slightly nasal with light vibrato, clearly sung melody, one lead voice. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 108 BPM, D major. Teasing, easygoing rooftop evening. No rap, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no synth pads, no EDM drop.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n厝頂搭一間鴿仔寮\n灰母鴿 逐工放出去\n彼日伊轉來 後壁綴一隻\n無環仔的雄鴿 企佇瓦頂\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我共米撒落 假做無看\n伊嘛假做 毋是來食\n\n[Chorus]\n一隻我的 一隻家己來的\n母鴿仔毋驚 蹛做伙\n我閣釘一塊板 加一个岫\n愛來就來 免客氣\n\n[Verse]\n隔壁阿伯 看著就罵\n講我的鴿 予人拐去\n我講 是伊家己揀的\n你敢有管過 人的姻緣\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n桶仔內的米 閣抓一把\n雄鴿仔偷看 我的手\n\n[Chorus]\n一隻我的 一隻家己來的\n母鴿仔毋驚 蹛做伙\n我閣釘一塊板 加一个岫\n愛蹛就蹛 免客氣\n\n[Verse]\n暗頭仔落雨 兩隻攏澹\n擠入新岫 毛仔相黏\n我徛佇樓梯口 看一下\n共電火關掉 轉去睏\n\n[Bridge]\n無環仔 無名 嘛無牌\n我叫伊 阿灰的翁\n\n[Chorus]\n一隻我的 一隻變成我的\n母鴿仔毋驚 蹛做伙\n我閣釘一塊板 加一个岫\n這遍換我 免客氣\n\n[Outro]\n加一个岫 加一把米\n厝頂 閣加一个伴",
